{
  "shots": [
    {
      "sentence": "I have worked the night shift at the city morgue for fifteen years.",
      "search_term": "man working late",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A tired man sitting at a desk in a dimly lit, sterile room.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_1.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.382
    },
    {
      "sentence": "The silence of the cold storage room is usually my only companion.",
      "search_term": "morgue storage room",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A row of stainless steel morgue drawers in a dark room.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_2.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.181
    },
    {
      "sentence": "Last night, the motion sensor light in the hallway flickered on without warning.",
      "search_term": "flickering hallway light",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A flickering fluorescent light in a dark, narrow hallway.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_3.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.422
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I checked the security monitor, but the long, sterile corridor appeared completely empty.",
      "search_term": "security camera footage",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A grainy black and white security camera view of an empty hallway.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_4.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.022
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I dismissed it as a faulty wire until I heard the distinct sound of bare feet slapping against the linoleum.",
      "search_term": "bare feet walking",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A close-up of bare feet walking on a cold, shiny floor.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_5.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 4.942
    },
    {
      "sentence": "The footsteps stopped directly outside the heavy steel door of my office.",
      "search_term": "heavy metal door",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A heavy metal door in a dark hallway.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_6.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.121
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I held my breath, clutching the heavy ring of keys until my knuckles turned white.",
      "search_term": "hand holding keys",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A close-up of a hand tightly gripping a large metal keychain.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_7.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.362
    },
    {
      "sentence": "Slowly, the handle began to turn, vibrating against the lock with rhythmic precision.",
      "search_term": "door handle turning",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A metal door handle slowly turning downward.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_8.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.161
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I braced myself, ready to confront a prankster or an intruder with everything I had.",
      "search_term": "person looking scared",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A person looking nervous and alert in a dark room.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_9.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.522
    },
    {
      "sentence": "Instead, the door creaked open to reveal a single, damp hospital gown folded neatly on the floor.",
      "search_term": "hospital gown floor",
      "media_type": "photo",
      "visual": "A white hospital gown lying on a dark floor.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_10.jpg",
      "duration_seconds": 4.702
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I stepped out to investigate, but the hallway remained as hollow and quiet as a tomb.",
      "search_term": "dark empty hallway",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A long, dark, empty corridor stretching into the shadows.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_11.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 4.442
    },
    {
      "sentence": "When I returned to my desk, my blood turned to ice as I glanced at the intake log.",
      "search_term": "person looking shocked",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A person looking shocked while looking down at a desk.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_12.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 4.803
    },
    {
      "sentence": "The book lay open to a fresh entry, written in my own handwriting.",
      "search_term": "writing in ledger",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A close-up of a hand holding a pen over an open ledger.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_13.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.065
    },
    {
      "sentence": "It listed my full name, the current time of death, and a cause that simply read: fright.",
      "search_term": "handwriting on paper",
      "media_type": "photo",
      "visual": "A close-up of text written on paper in a dark room.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_14.jpg",
      "duration_seconds": 4.367
    }
